OL,3,GNEWSASkateboarders take on Amsterdam
OL,4,Acharity challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo lifelong friends are attempting to
OL,7,Fskateboard 500km (310 miles) from the
OL,8,FUK to the Netherlands for a charity
OL,9,Ffundraising challenge.
OL,11,FCharlie Hutchings-Sait and Dan Lee set
OL,12,Foff from central London on Friday,
OL,13,Ftravelled through Kent and northern
OL,14,FFrance, reaching Ostend in Belgium on
OL,15,FTuesday afternoon.
OL,17,FThe pair, from New Milton, Hampshire
OL,18,Fand Southbourne have raised almost
OL,19,F#2,000 for the Alzheimer's Society,
OL,20,FMacMillan Cancer Support and road
OL,21,Fsafety charity Brake.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
